{"id":"i","lemma":"и","pos":"conj","rank":5,"glosses":["and","as well as, both ... and ...","as well"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/Ru-%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Где и когда мы встретимся?","en":"When and where shall we meet?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/681292","words":[{"g":"where"},null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретиться"}]},{"text":"Могу я остаться и помочь?","en":"Can I stay and help?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to remain, to stay"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Ты знаешь, как и когда?","en":"Do you know how and when?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"how / like"},null,{"g":"when"}]},{"text":"Я вижу мужчину и женщину.","en":"I see a man and a woman.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/196149","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Мы муж и жена.","en":"We are husband and wife.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"husband"},null,{"g":"wife"}]}]}